  CategoryIndex: 0
  Description: Raised when a vessel lands a shot on an OPPOSING
    vessel - a direct projectile hit or an opponent caught in a blast. Carries the
    shooter, the victim and the weapon class; StatsManager arbitrates who may record it
    (projectiles are local objects, so only the machine that fired one sees the hit).
